{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110556","id":2832133394,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ozu0S","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110556","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110556.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110556.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110556","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110556/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110556/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110556/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0d700e53f37e0facd999d7b0870858364b912361","number":110556,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Check for `NUL` characters in string parsing functions.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110545\r\n\r\nBefore my recent 4.5 changes, these functions used to stop parsing when they encountered a `NUL` in the given span.\r\nThis is incorrect behavior, because `NUL` is a valid unicode character, and we should be handling it gracefully.\r\n\r\nHowever, a large part of our APIs do not currently support `NUL` in strings (see https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11249). Therefore, we have to make do for the moment and replace them with the dedicated replacement char. Notably, `append_utf8` and `append_utf16` APIs still terminate early on `NUL` characters. This should be changed in a future PR.\r\n\r\nThis behavior is more correct than terminating the string early, which may lose information and return strings of incorrect length. In the future, we should strive towards support for `NUL` characters, to comply with the unicode standard correctly.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://a